#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:147
msgid "Magfit WebTools Utilty"
msgstr "Magfit WebTools 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:5
#: 0393828be78b46cfbb869ee4c79fe6d2
msgid "Advanced Compass Setup"
msgstr "高级罗盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:7
#: bc657ff3cdc04d259bcb4bf298944c72
msgid ""
"This article provides advanced guidance for how to setup the system "
"compass(es) and advanced compass related features."
msgstr "本文为如何设置系统罗盘及高级罗盘相关功能提供高级指导。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:11
#: f82eb666f6a241749975e92489b76c55
msgid ""
"Users who have only internal compasses or an external compass using a "
"UBlox GPS + compass combination,such as :ref:`UBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`, and have mounted it in"
" the default orientation can usually perform a simple \"Onboard "
"Calibration\" as described in :ref:`Compass Calibration <common-compass-"
"calibration-in-mission-planner>`)."
msgstr ""
"仅使用内部罗盘或使用 UBlox GPS + 罗盘组合的外置罗盘（例如 :ref:`UBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-"
"module>`）且按默认方向安装的用户，通常只需执行简单的「机载校准」，如 :ref:`Compass Calibration <common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`) 中所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:14
#: 3d6fb010efbe4aba8f38d44b537fc9f4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:16
#: 6919144ea6e042c9b44e8c2a7170c0c4
msgid ""
"Accurately setting up the compass is critical because it is the primary "
"source of heading information. Without an accurate heading the vehicle "
"will not move in the correct direction in autopilot modes (i.e. AUTO, "
"LOITER, PosHold, RTL, etc). This can lead to circling (aka "
"\"toiletbowling\") or fly-aways."
msgstr ""
"准确设置罗盘至关重要，因为它是航向信息的主要来源。如果航向不准确，飞行器在飞控模式下（即 AUTO、LOITER、PosHold、RTL "
"等）将无法朝正确方向移动。这可能导致绕圈（俗称「马桶效应」）或飞走。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:22
#: 5d3b5087162f46bea25f6f758cf11153
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows multiple compasses to be connected, but only three are "
"used at one time. And usually, only the primary compass is used, unless "
"there are consistency problems with its readings versus other compasses "
"and/or other sensors. In this case, the autopilot will automatically "
"determine which of the first three compasses to use."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"允许连接多个罗盘，但一次只使用三个。通常只使用主罗盘，除非其读数与其他罗盘和/或其他传感器存在一致性问题。在这种情况下，飞控将自动确定使用前三个罗盘中的哪一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:24
#: 716d6e1fab564bb2bfe89d44096e4777
msgid ""
"While many autopilots have an internal compass or compasses, many "
"applications will instead use an external compass. This provides more "
"reliable data than an internal compass because of the separation from "
"other electronics. See :ref:`common-autopilots` for details about the "
"specific autopilot to determine how many built-in compasses the autopilot"
" may have, if any."
msgstr ""
"虽然许多飞控具有内置罗盘，但许多应用会使用外置罗盘。由于与其他电子设备的距离较远，外置罗盘提供的数据比内置罗盘更可靠。有关特定飞控内置罗盘数量的详细信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`common-autopilots`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:28
#: c100d0d3a9284bceb95437eddeb7acd7
msgid ""
"Most users will only need to  perform the normal :ref:`Compass "
"Calibration<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` but details "
"are also given on the less-used  :ref:`CompassMot <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
msgstr ""
"大多数用户只需执行常规 :ref:`Compass Calibration<common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner>`，但也会提供较少使用的 :ref:`CompassMot <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
" 的详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:32
#: 11103aaa4b76455bb2d2986530202c31
msgid "Compass Settings"
msgstr "罗盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:34
#: b2a3c18d6c3c47948ac2d9878e170853
msgid ""
"The *Mission Planner Compass Setup screen* can be found in menu **Setup "
"\\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Compass** in the sidebar. This screen is used "
"for setting compass ordering, priority, calibration, and use. No other "
"settings are required for normal use."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner 罗盘设置界面* 可在侧边栏菜单 **Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| "
"Compass** 中找到。此界面用于设置罗盘排序、优先级、校准和使用。正常使用不需要其他设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:41
#: f5dc6341db11485a86c267a7863cf402
msgid "Mission Planner: Advanced Compass Setup and Calibration"
msgstr "Mission Planner：高级罗盘设置与校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:45
#: e8a21e5cd0b049408e3ae2e449326e21
msgid "Compass Ordering and Priority"
msgstr "罗盘排序与优先级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:47
#: b965618d1e144df7b2c243091d98734c
msgid ""
"During boot, ArduPilot automatically detects the compasses present in the"
" system, adds them to a list, and assigns the first three a priority "
"(1-3) linked to their DEV ID (``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID``), according to the "
"order in which they are discovered. This priority determines which "
"compass is used by the EKF lanes. The primary compass (highest priority, "
"1) will be used by all lanes, and fallback to the next viable compass in "
"the first three priorities, if the primary becomes unhealthy."
msgstr ""
"启动时，ArduPilot 会自动检测系统中存在的罗盘，将其添加到列表中，并根据发现顺序为前三个罗盘分配优先级（1-3），并通过其设备 "
"ID（``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID``）进行关联。此优先级决定了 EKF "
"通道使用哪个罗盘。主罗盘（最高优先级，1）将被所有通道使用，如果主罗盘不健康，则回退到前三个优先级中下一个可用的罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:49
#: d76a3d2cca4c40cc96f93efe4c1c65a7
msgid ""
"The list of discovered compasses and their priority is maintained across "
"boots."
msgstr "已发现罗盘的列表及其优先级在重启后保持不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:51
#: fb5b6e63559f4910b5f858fb398419f2
msgid ""
"If a user wishes to change to a different compass for one of the three "
"priorities, he can change the ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` to that compass's "
"``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID value. If a ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` is set to zero, "
"the compasses will be moved up contiguously, in order, to fill that "
"priority slot on the next reboot. This is easily done in Mission Planner "
"with the arrows on the right side."
msgstr ""
"如果用户希望将某个优先级更改为不同的罗盘，可以将 ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` 更改为该罗盘的 ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx``"
" ID 值。如果将 ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` 设置为零，则罗盘将在下次重启时按顺序连续向上填充该优先级位置。在 Mission "
"Planner 中，通过右侧的箭头可以轻松完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:53
#: b23555a93b9c43c7bcc1d2e74ccdc008
msgid ""
"never change a compass's ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID value manually and then "
"reboot!"
msgstr "切勿手动更改罗盘的 ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID 值后重启！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:55
#: 647c298e2c07409d980d1bff2994ed8b
msgid ""
"If a previously discovered compass is missing or not detected on boot, "
"and is in one of the three priority positions, a pre-arm failure will "
"occur warning the user. The user will need to either remove the compass "
"from the priority position, or correct the problem in order to prevent "
"the pre-arm failure. Mission Planner provides a button to remove an "
"undetected compass on the above screen."
msgstr ""
"如果之前发现的罗盘在启动时缺失或未被检测到，且处于三个优先级位置之一，则会发生预解锁失败，警告用户。用户需要从优先级位置中移除该罗盘，或纠正问题以防止预解锁失败。Mission"
" Planner 在上述界面提供了删除未检测到罗盘的按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:57
#: 781827a29e104f26b2e4a12298b9905a
msgid ""
"Compasses not present or detected during a calibration will automatically"
" be removed."
msgstr "在校准过程中未出现或未被检测到的罗盘将被自动移除。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:60
#: 840d06e41d1f49ceb3a2369686487069
msgid "Compass Enables"
msgstr "罗盘启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:62
#: 73ed4069f5924de0849b14e19739f37c
msgid ""
"Any one of the first three compasses can be disabled. This would leave "
"only the remaining ones to be used by the autopilot. You may wish to "
"disable any internal compasses if you are consistently seeing the "
"“inconsistent compasses” pre-arm message often and you are sure that the "
"external compass is calibrated."
msgstr "前三个罗盘中的任意一个都可以被禁用。这将只留下其余罗盘供飞控使用。如果您经常看到「罗盘不一致」的预解锁提示，并且确定外置罗盘已校准，则可以考虑禁用所有内置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:66
#: 8f2864b19b804c2d917c5ac88dde2ebc
msgid ""
"Compasses should always be enabled for Copter/Rover, but may be disabled "
"(not recommended, if one is available) for Plane."
msgstr "对于旋翼机/漫游车，罗盘应始终启用，但对于飞机可以禁用（如果有罗盘，不建议禁用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:69
#: 672263c4411a4341b0c0f3f2ad767ac3
msgid "Orientation"
msgstr "方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:71
#: c7043683cd294ecf9cee1779178ec313
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` must be set correctly for "
"the compass calibration to be successful. In addition,the :ref:`common-"
"accelerometer-calibration` should be completed before the Compass "
"Calibration."
msgstr ""
"必须正确设置 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`，才能成功进行罗盘校准。此外，应在罗盘校准之前完成"
" :ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:73
#: 9a2e45953935403c816620fe30610683
msgid ""
"The setting of the orientation of external compasses is no longer "
"required. It's determined automatically during :ref:`common-compass-"
"calibration-in-mission-planner` now. This can be disabled, or only report"
" the orientation determined during Compass Calibration, using the "
":ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` parameter. The orientation "
"determination CAN fail if the magnetic fields are compromised by nearby "
"metal or other interference, especially on 45 deg offset orientations. If"
" the compass is known to be mounted on a 45 degree bias to the "
"accelerometers, and fails to determine orientation during the Compass "
"Calibration, then setting :ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` to "
"\"3\" and repeating the calibration, may yield a successful completion."
msgstr ""
"现在不再需要手动设置外置罗盘的方向，它会在 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner` 期间自动确定。可以使用 :ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` "
"参数禁用此功能，或仅报告罗盘校准期间确定的方向。如果附近有金属或其他干扰，尤其是在 45 "
"度偏移方向上，方向确定可能失败。如果已知罗盘相对于加速度计以 45 度偏置安装，且在罗盘校准期间无法确定方向，则将 "
":ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` 设置为「3」并重复校准可能会成功完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:75
#: 4295fe310cfa4a6d916d4f4ffe57b631
msgid ""
"automatic determination of compass orientation ONLY occurs using normal "
"Compass Calibration. :ref:`In-flight Calibration<automatic-compass-"
"offset-calibration>` and :ref:`Large Vehicle Mag Calibration <large-"
"vehicle-mag-cal>` require that the orientation be properly set BEFORE "
"attempting these types of calibration."
msgstr ""
"罗盘方向的自动确定仅在正常罗盘校准时发生。:ref:`飞行中校准<automatic-compass-offset-calibration>` 和"
" :ref:`大型飞行器磁校准 <large-vehicle-mag-cal>` 要求在尝试这些类型的校准之前正确设置方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:77
#: 6bc08db71c214228a4d573e06d6ccfd1
msgid ""
"However, if the need to double-check the orientation of a compass should "
"arise:"
msgstr "但是，如果需要再次检查罗盘方向："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:79
#: 34e6bf1ea9ed4c7b9e515dd49dc49ce2
msgid ""
"When rotating your aircraft through all axes each of the compasses should"
" move in the same direction, and should be of approximately the same "
"values:"
msgstr "当您将飞行器在所有轴上旋转时，每个罗盘应沿相同方向移动，且数值应大致相同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:84
#: 7f58df4078ae4d17901501f558dd24e3
msgid "Northern Hemisphere:"
msgstr "北半球："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:82
#: 5fb5c91df831461e8fc400c1c9add49b
msgid "Z-component should be *positive*"
msgstr "Z 分量应为 *正值*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:83
#: 325a7bec0af540b59f94abc2c117b803
msgid "when pitching the vehicle down, the X component should *increase* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向下俯仰时，X 分量应 *增大*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:84
#: 4c9a701b7c354c5bbb4b71293c8cb4dc
msgid "when rolling the vehicle right, the Y component should *increase* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向右横滚时，Y 分量应 *增大*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:89
#: c443eb4af82040cbaac05e494227b198
msgid "Southern Hemisphere:"
msgstr "南半球："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:87
#: 5422fd647dac463fa32512e90363276c
msgid "Z-component should be *negative*"
msgstr "Z 分量应为 *负值*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:88
#: 0314bd5813ae4c0587629904bbbe0f12
msgid "when pitching the vehicle down, the X component should *decrease* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向下俯仰时，X 分量应 *减小*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:89
#: c537edc679d44228bfe2a60e6989334d
msgid "when rolling the vehicle right, the Y component should *decrease* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向右横滚时，Y 分量应 *减小*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:92
#: 5ac9b0504c684dab9585fad051d11031
msgid "Other parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:94
#: c86770d49d204b36b6512217cc7ce66d
msgid ""
"Earlier versions of ArduPilot did not incorporate the world magnetic "
"model database, and a locations magnetic declination might need to "
"manually entered, or learned through flight. This is not necessary now. "
"In addition, this allows the declination to be continuously updated on "
"long distance flights."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"的早期版本未包含世界磁场模型数据库，某地点的磁偏角可能需要手动输入或通过飞行学习。现在已不再需要此操作。此外，这还允许在长途飞行中持续更新磁偏角。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:96
#: 22260e4be23d46a5ab072b9e4ff08a75
msgid ""
"Also, learning the compass offsets in flight, instead of ground "
"calibration, is an option for vehicles difficult to move in order to "
"calibrate. But is not recommended, since the Large Vehicle MagCal option "
"is now available. See :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner` page for details."
msgstr ""
"此外，在飞行中学习罗盘偏移量（而不是地面校准）是难以移动以进行校准的飞行器的一个选项。但不建议使用，因为大型飞行器 MagCal "
"选项现在已可用。有关详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` "
"页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:104
#: 01caac7864c342499125f1932153b16d
msgid "Automatic Offset Calibration"
msgstr "自动偏移校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:106
#: 93fa65146fc04b7f85c562c7aaec4948
msgid ""
"DO NOT USE THIS WITH GPS-DERIVED YAW! ie :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw` in  "
"firmware versions before 4.5.2!"
msgstr "请勿在 4.5.2 之前的固件版本中与 GPS 衍生偏航（即 :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`）一起使用！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:108
#: 43adf3a38a9e42a0b61293b659cc4ee6
msgid ""
"In the 4.0 and later releases of ArduPilot, an automatic offset learning "
"feature is available. The :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` parameter "
"determines how this feature works. This is for advanced users and not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本中，提供了自动偏移学习功能。:ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` "
"参数决定此功能的工作方式。这适用于高级用户，不建议一般用户使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:110
#: d9100aa854da4974ad66884d47b1b20c
msgid ""
"If set to 3, the offsets will be learned automatically during flight, be "
"saved, and this parameter reset to 0. Position control modes (Loiter, "
"Auto, etc.) should not be used while the offsets are being learned."
msgstr "如果设置为 3，偏移量将在飞行过程中自动学习，保存后该参数重置为 0。在学习偏移量期间，不应使用位置控制模式（Loiter、Auto 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:112
#: 86a0343dca8547da91fd119dbae4a78e
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` to 1 or 2 is not recommended."
" These modes are deprecated and are either non-functional, or still in "
"development."
msgstr "不建议将 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` 设置为 1 或 2。这些模式已弃用，要么无功能，要么仍在开发中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:114
#: e51913d5c45246f385d0015327d807cf
msgid "The procedure for :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3 is:"
msgstr ":ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3 的程序为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:116
#: 0cbc1ee4b83c4ab7be4b38e035917e79
msgid ""
"set :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3. The message “CompassLearn: "
"Initialised” will appear on the MP’s message tab (it does not appear in "
"red letters on the HUD)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` 设置为 3。Mission Planner "
"的消息选项卡上将出现「CompassLearn: Initialised」消息（不以红色字母显示在 HUD 上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:117
#: 052a33bbc51044a1b183ce1dfe96802b
msgid ""
"“Bad Compass” will appear but this is nothing to be worried about. We "
"will hopefully make this disappear before the final release."
msgstr "「Bad Compass」将会出现，但无需担心。我们希望在最终发布之前使其消失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:118
#: b9ecf79685654bd99b800091c42a3620
msgid ""
"Arm and drive/fly the vehicle around in whatever mode you like, do some "
"turns “CompassLearn: have earth field” should appear on MP’s message tab "
"and then eventually “CompassLearn: finished”."
msgstr ""
"解锁并以任意模式驾驶/飞行飞行器，进行一些转弯，「CompassLearn: have earth field」应出现在 Mission "
"Planner 的消息选项卡上，最终显示「CompassLearn: finished」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:120
#: 2c1d22dfc0254615bdc4dd953071fa15
msgid ""
"You MUST have a GPS lock and signal for this to be successful. Be sure "
"the GPS has a clear \"view\" of the sky and there are no obstructions "
"blocking the GPS signals."
msgstr "要成功完成此操作，必须有 GPS 锁定和信号。确保 GPS 对天空有清晰的「视野」，没有遮挡物阻挡 GPS 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:122
#: b65deea0afce49c4bc03ce7497f5f837
msgid ""
"If you want you can check the :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` "
"parameter has been set back to zero (you may need to refresh parameters "
"to see this) and the COMPASS_OFS_X/Y/Z values will have changed."
msgstr ""
"如果需要，您可以检查 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` "
"参数是否已重置为零（您可能需要刷新参数才能看到），并且 COMPASS_OFS_X/Y/Z 的值将会改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:123
#: f077c709e14f4ab2affe91e9ce93d7fd
msgid ""
"This method can also be evoked using the RCxOPTION for \"Compass Learn\"."
" It will activate when the channel goes above 1800uS and automatically "
"complete and save."
msgstr "此方法也可以使用「Compass Learn」的 RCxOPTION 触发。当通道值超过 1800uS 时激活，并自动完成和保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:128
#: 5f643b985d3a45c78676f7c55555a795
msgid "Compass error messages"
msgstr "罗盘错误消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:130
#: 6c949885dadf4921b8e99281a7a0e032
msgid ""
"**Compass Health**: The compass has not sent a signal for at least half a"
" second."
msgstr "**Compass Health**：罗盘至少半秒未发送信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:132
#: 5f04994b2c4e4e8991815934c86aacbb
msgid ""
"**Compass Variance**: In the EKF solution, compass heading disagrees with"
" the heading estimate from other inertial sensors. Clicking the EKF "
"button on the Mission Planner HUD will show the magnitude of the error."
msgstr ""
"**Compass Variance**：在 EKF 解算中，罗盘航向与其他惯性传感器估计的航向不一致。单击 Mission Planner "
"HUD 上的 EKF 按钮将显示误差大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:136
#: b18ed2be5f124b049ff3279f064a903b
msgid "**Compass Not Calibrated**: The compass needs to be calibrated."
msgstr "**Compass Not Calibrated**：罗盘需要进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:137
#: f996c1cee24e4e6bbda1837d58396722
msgid ""
"**Compass Offsets High**: One of your compass offsets exceeds 600, "
"indicating likely magnetic interference. Check for sources of "
"interference and try calibrating again."
msgstr "**Compass Offsets High**：您的某个罗盘偏移量超过 600，表明可能存在磁干扰。请检查干扰源并尝试重新校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:142
#: 444444a9958f4c92a6e35fab6f21d565
msgid "Refining Calibration Parameters using a Flight Log"
msgstr "使用飞行日志优化校准参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:144
#: ff47d814148c49bf884c57d174eff28f
msgid ""
"The compass offsets, scales, diagonals, and even motor compensation can "
"be determined from a flight dataflash log of the vehicle using an "
"analysis utility."
msgstr "可以使用分析工具从飞行器的飞行数据日志中确定罗盘偏移量、缩放比例、对角线值，甚至电机补偿。"

